\r (Luke 3.23-38)
\z# <- comment.line.reference.usfm keyword.other.reference.usfm
\z#^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ comment.line.reference.usfm
\z#              ^ meta.whitespace.newline.usfm
\p
\v 1 This is the list of the ancestors of Jesus Christ, a descendant of David,
\z# <- punctuation.definition.verse.begin.usfm
\z#^ meta.number.integer.decimal.usfm constant.numeric.value.usfm
who was a descendant of Abraham.


\z# https://docs.usfm.bible/usfm/3.1.1/para/lists/li.html
\id NUM
\c 7
\p
\v 84-88 The totals of the offerings brought by the twelve leaders for the
\z# <- punctuation.definition.verse.begin.usfm
\z#^^ meta.number.integer.decimal.usfm constant.numeric.value.usfm
\z#  ^ punctuation.separator.range.usfm
\z#   ^^ meta.number.integer.decimal.usfm constant.numeric.value.usfm
dedication of the altar were as follows:
\li1 –twelve silver bowls and twelve silver basins weighing a total of 60 pounds
\li1 –twelve gold dishes weighing a total of 48 ounces, filled with incense
\li1 –twelve bulls, twelve rams, and twelve one-year-old lambs, plus the grain
offerings that go with them, for the burnt offerings
\li1 –twelve goats for the sin offerings
\z#^ markup.list.usfm punctuation.definition.list_item.usfm
\li1 –twenty-four bulls, sixty rams, sixty goats, sixty one-year-old lambs, for
the fellowship offerings


\z# https://docs.usfm.bible/usfm/3.1.1/char/notes/footnote/fq.html
\p
\v 1 This is the Good News about Jesus Christ, the Son of God.\f + \fr 1.1:
\z#^ meta.number.integer.decimal.usfm constant.numeric.value.usfm
\z#                                                           ^^^^ markup.info.footnote.usfm
\z#                                                           ^^ punctuation.definition.annotation.begin.usfm
